# Internal working notes, same class as CLAUDE.md and the docs above: they steer the
# work, they are not the work. Ignored rather than merely untracked for the same reason
# as the block above — `git add -A` should not be able to sweep them into a public commit.
OPEN-QUESTIONS.md
ANSWERS.md

# Third-party STRK20 agent skills, installed via:
#   npx skills add welttowelt/strk20-skills
# 312K of upstream documentation bundled verbatim. Ignored rather than vendored
# because it is reinstallable in one command and is not our work. To vendor it
# instead (self-contained clones), delete this line and `git add .agents/`.
.agents/
.upstream/
# Copied in by devtool's `prepack` and removed by `postpack` — npm auto-includes README and
# LICENSE only from the package root, and both live at the repo root by deliberate choice
# (E-PUB2, claude-docs/DECISIONS-NEEDED.md D4). Ignored so an interrupted pack cannot commit a
# second copy of either.
devtool/README.md
devtool/LICENSE

# web/ — the marketing site.
#
# ⛔ THE RESTRICTED ASSETS ARE NOW COMMITTED, BY THE USER'S DECISION OF 2026-09-05.
#
# `NON-Natural-Grotesk-Regular.woff2` is licensed to the author for PERSONAL USE, and
# `web/public/hydra.svg` / `web/app/icon.svg` are Marvel's HYDRA insignia — a third party's
# trademark, not a licence the author holds. Both were excluded here, and `build:public`
# substituted a fallback face and a plain glyph so a published build carried neither.
#
# The user was told the concern and decided: *"ship it anyway (will replace once commissioned work
# returns, currently we need it to verify the UI/UX and the rest)."* It is their project and their
# exposure. **This is a held position pending commissioned art, not an oversight.**
#
# ⛔ TO REVERT WHEN THE COMMISSIONED MARK LANDS, three things move together or nothing changes:
#   1. re-add the three paths below this comment,
#   2. `web/vercel.json` buildCommand back to `npm run build:public`,
#   3. `HYDRA_ASSETS=licensed` in `web/scripts/assert-public.ts` (it does not need deleting — it
#      inverts, and under `licensed` it asserts exactly what it always did).
#
# The other three faces (Geist, Geist Mono, Instrument Serif) are OFL and were always committed.

web/.next/
web/out/
